The Midget's Tiny wagon~
    The cheap Gypsy Fair Owner believes in rewarding people according
to their stature.  Accordingly, this wagon is so small that even the
Midget thinks that it is a tight fit.  The poor Midget is also the
poorest paid of all the Freaks.  But that doesn't bother him.  He has
a second profession that he practices on the side to make a little
extra cash.  He also keeps a rather large guard dog in his wagon to
discourage visitors.
