#24441
The Illusionist's wagon~
    This wagon seems much larger on the inside that it does on the
outside.  You see a spacious, king-sized bed, a large table and
kitchenette, and a separate sitting room.  The longer that you look
though, you see that all the objects in the room have a slight
shimmer to them.  Closer examination reveals that the bed is a cot,
the table a nightstand, and the sitting room is a chair.  It appears
the Illusionist tries to fool even himself sometimes. 
~
